      "text": "**Yes—the haze is still bad in Singapore today, October 17.** The latest readings I found, at **11 a.m.**, put the 24-hour PSI at **139–184 across the regions**, which is **unhealthy**. Conditions have improved from Friday, but fine-particle levels were still elevated, with a high 1-hour PM2.5 reading in the West. ([haze.sg](https://www.haze.sg/?utm_source=openai))\n\nIf you’re heading outdoors, check the latest **1-hour PM2.5** reading first; consider avoiding strenuous outdoor activity if it’s high. ([haze.gov.sg](https://www.haze.gov.sg/?trk=public_profile__reactions-text))",
